title: PyData Südwest - Community Partner
---
full_description: PyData Südwest is a dynamic community connecting data science and AI
enthusiasts across Heidelberg, Mannheim, Karlsruhe, and Heilbronn. This
region, renowned for its thriving tech ecosystem and innovation hubs, plays a
pivotal role in advancing AI research and applications in Germany. PyData
Südwest fosters collaboration and knowledge exchange through engaging meetups
and events, creating a welcoming space for professionals, researchers, and
students to share ideas, explore cutting-edge technologies, and strengthen the
local AI and open-source community.
